desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "python"
	title: "检测 Python requests verify=False"
	title_zh: "检测 Python requests verify=False"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-python-requests-verify-false"
	risk: "certificate-validation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 requests 关闭 TLS 证书校验，连接易受中间人攻击。

### 风险类型
certificate-validation

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
删除 verify=False，使用系统或指定 CA 校验证书。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://http.py": <<<POS
import requests
def get(url):
    return requests.get(url, verify=False)

POS
	"safefile://http-safe.py": <<<NEG
import requests
def get(url):
    return requests.get(url)

NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/verify\s*=\s*False/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "检测 Python requests verify=False",
	title_zh: "检测 Python requests verify=False",
	message: "检测 Python requests verify=False",
	risk: "certificate-validation",
}
